    title: AIT Alert Data Set
    authors:
      - family-names: Landauer
        given-names: Max
      - family-names: Skopik
        given-names: Florian
      - family-names: Wurzenberger
        given-names: Markus
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.8263181
    url: 'https://zenodo.org/records/8263181'
    license: CC-BY-4.0
    notes: >-
      Intrusion detection alerts from eight simulated company environments,
      published by the Austrian Institute of Technology. Meerkat is trained and
      evaluated on this data set.
